---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  description="Privacy policy for GSoC Organizations, including browser-local data and external links."
>
  <main class="prose-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Organizations</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page"
        >Privacy policy</span
      >
    </nav>
    <div class="page-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy by default</span>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>
        GSoC Organizations is designed to work without accounts, advertising, or
        behavioral tracking. Last updated 6 November 2026.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose-grid">
      <article class="detail-card prose-card">
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          The site does not collect personal information, create user profiles,
          run analytics, or serve advertising. There are no account, payment, or
          newsletter forms.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="detail-card prose-card">
        <h2>Browser-local data</h2>
        <p>
          Saved organizations and research notes are stored only in your
          browser’s local storage. They are not transmitted to this project or
          synchronized between devices. Clearing site data removes them.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="detail-card prose-card">
        <h2>External websites</h2>
        <p>
          Organization websites, source repositories, LinkedIn, GitHub, and the
          official GSoC website are third-party services with their own privacy
          practices. Following an external link leaves this site.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="detail-card prose-card">
        <h2>Source and contact</h2>
        <p>
          The project’s source code and data methodology are available in the
          <a
            href="https://github.com/rohanmalhotracodes/GSoC-Organizations"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer">GitHub repository ↗</a
          >. Privacy questions can be raised through the repository or sent to
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rohanmalhotracodes/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer">Rohan Malhotra on LinkedIn ↗</a
          >.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
